WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:07.130
In 782 BC,
Argishti I, king of Urartu,

2
00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:10.672
raised a new fortress
on the hill of Arin Berd.

3
00:00:10.712 --> 00:00:12.674
He named it Erebuni.

4
00:00:12.914 --> 00:00:16.124
His founding inscription,
cut in cuneiform,

5
00:00:16.164 --> 00:00:17.964
still tells the story.

6
00:00:18.021 --> 00:00:20.511
From its walls, the kings of Urartu

7
00:00:20.551 --> 00:00:22.839
struck north toward Lake Sevan.

8
00:00:23.079 --> 00:00:25.818
Yet the name lives on in Yerevan.

9
00:00:26.058 --> 00:00:28.465
Defend the young city.

